Moonlight Security bundles three separate tools.

vendor/remnanode-antiscan and vendor/server-shield keep their own MIT licenses.
trafficguard/traffic-guard is the Traffic Guard binary used with the public
subnet lists from shadow-netlab/traffic-guard-lists.

